<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 72.2153 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 72.2153 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 72.2153 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday from 72.0951 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 28		  Nov 27</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  72.2153		 72.0951</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     4.005		  11.470</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
